From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coffeemeist3r <jordanyehle@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:40:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] zink: recreate every sampler view surface on rebind

rebind_image() and zink_rebind_all_images() refreshed only
sv->image_view after a resource got a new backing object (for example the
ZINK_BIND_MUTABLE switch that zink_get_surface() itself triggers). The
view's cube_array and zs_view surfaces still belonged to the old object, and
get_imageview_for_binding() hands those out. Once the old object was freed,
its surfaces went with it, and the next descriptor update wrote a garbage
VkImageView.

Imagination drivers set needs_zs_shader_swizzle, so every view with a
constant-1 swizzle (RGBX/BGRX alpha) gets a zs_view there. Steam's web
helper (Chromium on ANGLE on Zink) hit this within seconds of fast Home
shelf scrolling on a Pixel 10 Pro Fold and segfaulted in the driver's
vkUpdateDescriptorSetWithTemplate. Rebuild all of the view's surfaces with
init_sampler_view() instead. Still present in Mesa main.
---
diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/zink/zink_context.c b/src/gallium/drivers/zink/zink_context.c
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/zink/zink_context.c
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/zink/zink_context.c
@@ -5351,8 +5351,8 @@ rebind_image(struct zink_context *ctx, struct zink_resource *res)
             struct zink_sampler_view *sv = zink_sampler_view(ctx->sampler_views[i][j]);
             if (sv && sv->base.texture == &res->base.b) {
                sv->rebind_count = res->rebind_count;
-               struct pipe_surface tmpl = pipe_surface_templ_from_sampler_view(&sv->base, &res->base.b, sv->base.target);
-               sv->image_view = zink_get_surface(ctx, &tmpl, &sv->ivci);
+               /* recreate every surface of the view: cube_array and zs_view belong to the old object too */
+               init_sampler_view(ctx, sv);
                ctx->invalidate_descriptor_state(ctx, i, ZINK_DESCRIPTOR_TYPE_SAMPLER_VIEW, j, 1);
                update_descriptor_state_sampler(ctx, i, j, res);
             }
@@ -5457,8 +5457,7 @@ zink_rebind_all_images(struct zink_context *ctx)
          struct zink_resource *res = zink_resource(sv->base.texture);
          if (res->rebind_count != sv->rebind_count) {
             sv->rebind_count = res->rebind_count;
-            struct pipe_surface tmpl = pipe_surface_templ_from_sampler_view(&sv->base, &res->base.b, sv->base.target);
-            sv->image_view = zink_get_surface(ctx, &tmpl, &sv->ivci);
+            init_sampler_view(ctx, sv);
             ctx->invalidate_descriptor_state(ctx, i, ZINK_DESCRIPTOR_TYPE_SAMPLER_VIEW, j, 1);
             update_descriptor_state_sampler(ctx, i, j, res);
          }
